{"evalSetVersion":"chat-quality-v1","runId":"2026-04-26T12-29-56-529Z","evalMode":"pilot","runStartedAt":"2026-04-26T12:29:56.531Z","rowStartedAt":"2026-04-26T12:30:17.252Z","baseURL":"https://kabuyomi-api.dznqjmctk7.workers.dev","deviceKey":"eval-chat-quality-v1","appVersion":"dea51eb","ticker":"NVDA","filingKey":"v6:0001045810:000104581026000021","questionId":"NVDA-01","question":"何の会社？","intent":"business_overview","expectedFocus":["GPU/アクセラレーテッドコンピューティング","データセンター","ゲーム等の事業"],"answer":"NVIDIA CORPは、コンピューティングとネットワーキング、およびグラフィックスの技術を提供している会社です。主な収益源は、データセンターやゲーミング、プロフェッショナル向け視覚化、車載向けなどの製品とサービスです。\n\n直近の決算では、全社売上高が前年比65%増の2,159億3,800万ドルとなり、特にコンピューティングとネットワーキング部門の売上が1,934億7,900万ドルに急増し、大きな成長を牽引しています。注意点として、売上高の成長に伴い、売上原価率が25%から28.9%へ上昇し、粗利率が71.1%という高い水準ながらもわずかに低下しています。","sources":[{"sourceId":"S9","sourceKind":"sec_filing","sourceStrength":"filing_primary","sectionType":"xbrl_metric","sourceLabel":"XBRL 売上高 (Revenues)","excerpt":"売上高: 215938000000 USD / 比較値: 130497000000 / YoY: 65.5%","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1045810/000104581026000021/nvda-20260125.htm"},{"sourceId":"CTX1","sourceKind":"sec_filing","sourceStrength":"filing_primary","sectionType":"md_a","sourceLabel":"10-K Business overview context, filed 2026-02-25","excerpt":"39 Table of Contents The following table sets forth, for the periods indicated, certain items in our Consolidated Statements of Income expressed as a percentage of revenue. Year Ended Jan 25, 2026 Jan 26, 2025 Revenue 10","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1045810/000104581026000021/nvda-20260125.htm"}],"responsePath":"gemini","modelName":"gemma-4-31b-it","fallbackReason":null,"promptTokenCount":null,"sourceCount":2,"latencyMs":6668,"creditsCharged":2,"creditsRemaining":198,"creditBillingEnabled":true,"usageCredits":{"monthlyRemaining":0,"monthlyLimit":30,"purchasedRemaining":198,"totalRemaining":198,"resetsAt":"2026-05-01T00:00:00+09:00"},"answerRating":4,"failureLabelsObserved":["good"],"notes":"